at I think matters most: <strong>time together.<\/strong><\/p><p>It's full of fun ideas that get dad and kid doing things together, laughing, and above all enjoying each other. Moments like these become the memories kids keep forever.<\/p>","name":"Simona S., Ljubljana, Slovenia (translated from Slovenian)"}},"judgeme_widget_en":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/review_widget_homepage\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"product":"the-best-dad-book","review_data":"sample_data","max_width":1200}},"judgeme_widget":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/review_widget_homepage\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"product":"knjiga-najboljsi-fotr-na-svetu-komplet-s-plakatom-in-nalepkami","review_data":"sample_data","max_width":1200}}},"block_order":["review_tFVf6t","review_zfDjGb","judgeme_widget_en","judgeme_widget"],"name":"Landing: Judge","settings":{"heading_avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_7.webp","heading":"Don't just take our word for it. Here's what people who've already tried the kit say.","panel_heading":"Your turn.","panel_text":"Which mission did you do? Who won? What went wrong? Photos welcome.","panel_position":"top","panel_width":"full","market_split":true,"write_only":false,"widget_card":true,"hide_app_title":true,"show_button":false,"button_label":"Dad, tell us how it went","button_link":"https:\/\/judge.me\/product_reviews\/c703cde9-2e08-4cf3-978e-27bd133b7a1d\/new?source=shareable-link","color_scheme":"scheme1","panel_color_scheme":"scheme-ae7e43f1-0ad7-4ffe-8fb3-2c30cc53f86d","divider_top_color":"#2c2d45","divider_bottom_color":"#2a2d45","divider_style":"waves-1-patterned_1200x20","divider_animate":true}},"lado":{"type":"landing_quote_scheme","name":"Landing: Quote scheme","settings":{"quote":"»I'm no parenting expert. Nonsense, though? That I'm well qualified for.«","author":"Lado Bizovičar","author_role":"Slovenian TV comedian, dad of two girls, and author of the Slovenian edition"